console: /help
console:   Commands: help time weather gamemode difficulty tp give summon kill clear effect xp locate seed spawnpoint setblock vessel
console:   Tab completes names; arrow keys recall earlier commands.
console: /time set noon
console:   Set the time to 6000
console: /give diamond sword 1
console:   Gave 1 [Titanium Sword] to Player
console: /give hisser-head
console:   Gave 1 [Hisser Head] to Player
console: /locate sea temple
console:   Sea Temple: 328 ~ 928 (973 blocks)
console: /summon hisser
console:   Summoned new Hisser
console: <Player> hello
console: /tp ~ ~2 ~
console:   Teleported Player to 8.5, 88.0, 8.5
console: /bogus
console:   Unknown command: bogus. Type /help for a list
